     2433   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2434        b-quit AT ROW 1 COL 1
     2435        T-cost AT ROW 1 COL 64.63
     2436        B-Help AT ROW 1 COL 89
     2437        BR-dinamo AT ROW 2 COL 17
